        "tree_id": "4126c7b2e092a4840ecafd2504df495c33909926",
        "message": "fix(server): serve rooms through the validated live endpoint\n\nmain.ts now starts a second WebSocket server for rooms on 8788 while the\ntracer stays on 8787. attachRooms puts MessageGate on every frame (SEC-002);\nboth endpoints share the fixed 30 Hz tick and close together on SIGINT.\n\nRoomHub.ids is a small read-only accessor so the process can tick live rooms.\n\nReal loopback socket test: v3 hello -> welcome; malformed frame -> reject,\nwith the authoritative room hash unchanged. No fake socket in that test.\n\nRooms 19/19, full 302/302, verify 19/19, typecheck 0. Wiring only: no\nmatchmaking, persistence, 4-client measurement, art or GPU/TPU.\n\nAgent: backend-engineer\nTask: NET-003",
